1
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:58,880
Hello.

2
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:00,960
Mr. Wang.

3
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,320
Are you done?

4
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,519
I'm downstairs at the police station.

5
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:06,560
Just come down when you're finished.

6
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,920
Okay, wait for me.

7
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:13,080
Contact me anytime if you need anything, Officer Cao.

8
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,320
I won't hesitate.

9
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,000
When the time comes, Mr. Wang,

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,600
just don't find me annoying.

11
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:31,760
Are you done?

12
00:01:32,039 --> 00:01:32,720
Yes.

13
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,780
It was just a routine inquiry.

14
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,520
Are you sober now?

15
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:41,039
I don't even know how I got back to the hotel yesterday.

16
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,320
I'll carry you. Come on.

17
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,120
Our big hero.

18
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,320
I can carry you.

19
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,560
I'll carry you.

20
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,479
Why are you being so polite with us?

21
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:50,080
Come on.

22
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,200
Hand, hand, hand.

23
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,600
I'm stuck.

24
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,840
You stepped on my foot.

25
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,480
Miss Li, the room card.

26
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,100
What do you want to buy?

27
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,360
The room card.

28
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,360
I'll go right now.

29
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,740
I don't want to dance with you. Stop dancing.

30
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,440
We can never go there again.

31
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:23,440
This way.

32
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:24,840
One, two.

33
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:42,560
I'm a completely different person when I'm drunk.

34
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,880
You know that, right?

35
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:47,400
Miss Li, you are a bit much when you're drunk.

36
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,210
But it's no big deal.

37
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,000
That's good.

38
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,440
Have you been unhappy

39
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,440
about something lately?

40
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,120
Nothing.

41
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,160
Just some old stuff.

42
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,120
By the way.

43
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,680
Xue Ling contacted me this morning.

44
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,560
She said she felt bad

45
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,760
for scaring you yesterday.

46
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,440
Boss Lin wants to host a gathering tonight

47
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:10,560
to help you get over the shock

48
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,920
and introduce some timber factory bosses to you.

49
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,850
Do you want to go?

50
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:15,320
Where?

51
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,760
Jinding Karaoke.

52
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:17,880
Sure.

53
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,400
Officer Cao.

54
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,680
Officer Cao.

55
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:31,370
Officer Liu.

56
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:35,400
The arrowhead you gave me doesn't match

57
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,400
the fatal wound on Liu Ming's chest.

58
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,640
I see.

59
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,560
Thanks for your hard work.

60
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,160
Okay.

61
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:57,960
With this first glass of wine,

62
00:03:57,960 --> 00:04:00,120
let's toast to our safety.

63
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,360
I also hope

64
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,880
our business can be settled soon.

65
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,480
The timber you requested, Mr. Wang,

66
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,520
is large in quantity and high in quality.

67
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,160
If we settle it early,

68
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,760
we'll both feel at ease.

69
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,050
You're too kind, Mr. Lin. Come.

70
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,519
For the wood you want,

71
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,480
I've found a new source

72
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,560
over in Russia.

73
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,600
But 15-year-old aged wood

74
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,080
is indeed hard to find.

75
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,640
However, there's already some news.

76
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,560
At most,

77
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,320
by next month,

78
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:31,090
you'll definitely get your hands on the wood.

79
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,800
Come, a toast to Mr. Lin.

80
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,159
Then I'll be waiting for the wood.

81
00:04:35,159 --> 00:04:36,000
No problem.

82
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,040
By the way,

83
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,760
I heard someone mention a couple of days ago

84
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:48,490
that there's a small woodworking factory in the southern suburbs.

85
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,080
What was it called again?

86
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,700
Chenguang Woodworking Factory.

87
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,120
That boss

88
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,560
took an order from a school.

89
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:59,490
Helping that kid make those desks and chairs.

90
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,760
The delivery date is approaching,

91
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,120
but he's out of raw materials.

92
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,560
It looks like the order will fall through,

93
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,290
and he'll have to pay a penalty.

94
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:12,440
Mr. Lin, you really know about

95
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,120
everything in Xinchun, big and small.

96
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,520
It's such a small circle.

97
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,000
When people talk about things,

98
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,200
I just remember them.

99
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,960
What's wrong?

100
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,920
Do me a favor.

101
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,160
I won't hold it against you

102
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,440
for snatching my wooden fork last night.

103
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,240
What's wrong?

104
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,640
That's my family's wood.

105
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,520
If you help me get it back,

106
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,480
you can have as much as you want.

107
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,760
Stop the car! Stop!

108
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:41,240
Stop the car! Stop! Stop!

109
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,680
Stop the car.

110
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,260
By the way, Mr. Lin.

111
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:54,000
The boss of Chenguang Processing Factory,

112
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,060
what is their name?

113
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:57,159
Chenguang Processing Factory?

114
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,890
Her name is Chen Lu, I think.

115
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,160
Mr. Wang,

116
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:03,610
you seem quite interested in this person.

117
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,840
I was just asking.

118
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:06,720
Come, Mr. Lin.

119
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,480
Cheers.

120
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,360
Hello?

121
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:40,840
Who is it?

122
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,880
Do you still have black timber?

123
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,280
Yes.

124
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,920
I saw your number on Tieba.

125
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,400
I have a boss here

126
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,200
who needs some black timber.

127
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,720
What's the price for Korean pine now?

128
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,760
Market price?

129
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,120
Do you have Manchurian ash?

130
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:58,800
Yes.

131
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,610
We have all kinds of timber.

132
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,060
How about this?

133
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,760
I'll contact my boss

134
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,040
to see exactly how much he needs.

135
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,100
I'll call you back.

136
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,040
Okay.

137
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:08,960
By the way,

138
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,880
is the delivery location in Xinchun?

139
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,760
In Xinchun.

140
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:13,720
Okay.

141
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,780
Is it still this phone number?

142
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,720
Yes.

143
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,000
The number hasn't changed.

144
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,920
Contact me if you need anything.

145
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:20,920
Okay.

146
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,640
I got it.

147
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:22,680
Okay.

148
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,200
Still no news?

149
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,880
What are you all doing?

150
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,760
Calm down, Boss Tiger.

151
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,320
Because of Mr. Teng,

152
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,720
you've been very angry these past two days.

153
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,050
Don't ruin your health.

154
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,320
How can I not be angry?

155
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,370
This kid caused such a big mess.

156
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,500
Now there's no sign of him.

157
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,650
I don't even know if he's dead or alive.

158
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,920
I'm angry.

159
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,840
I'm going crazy.

160
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,380
Mr. Teng probably knows what he's doing.

161
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,600
He's just hiding out

162
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,560
to lay low.

163
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,560
When this blows over,

164
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,120
he'll contact us.

165
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,120
Lay low?

166
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,920
Does he have the brains for that?

167
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,840
If he had the brains,

168
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,370
he wouldn't have done this.

169
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,200
Beating someone is one thing,

170
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:15,520
but why use a gun?

171
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:16,920
There's no news of him.

172
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,360
I'm so worried.

173
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,520
The police are looking for him everywhere now.

174
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,520
What should we do?

175
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,360
Ahui, do this.

176
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,280
Send more people.

177
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,760
If you can't find him in Xinchun,

178
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,690
look in the city.

179
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,320
If you can't find him in the city,

180
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,520
look in the province.

181
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:35,320
Dig three feet deep and drag this kid back to me.

182
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,640
I'll go look right now.

183
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,240
I'll check a few more places.

184
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,240
Wait.

185
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,880
Well...

186
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,080
How's the factory recently?

187
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,640
The factory is fine.

188
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:46,300
I've been keeping an eye on it.

189
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,080
What about Wang Hong?

190
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,120
I heard he came to Xinchun to buy mahogany.

191
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,960
Did he get any?

192
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:54,600
Mr. Wang hasn't signed a contract with any new boss yet.

193
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,960
But as for Lin Shengli,

194
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,920
there's a new development with him.

195
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,160
What is he up to?

196
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,920
Mr. Lin's men

197
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,800
detained the batch of timber

198
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,720
for Chenguang Wood Factory's order.

199
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,120
Chenguang Wood Factory?

200
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,260
What's the boss's name again?

201
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,360
Chen Lu, right?

202
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,840
Yes, that's her.

203
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,440
This Lin Shengli,

204
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,440
why would he bully a woman?

205
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,640
This guy is just sinister.

206
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,560
Petty.

207
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,800
What happened to our Xiaohu

208
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,800
might have something to do with him.

209
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,160
If he muddies the water,

210
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,160
I won't let him fish for free.

211
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:30,880
We can't let Lin Shengli

212
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,240
get all the benefits.

213
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,160
Here's what you do.

214
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:36,360
Send people to keep an eye on both sides.

215
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,520
One on Wang Hong,

216
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,520
and one on Chenguang Wood Factory.

217
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,850
Tell me immediately if anything happens.

218
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:43,960
Okay.

219
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:44,800
By the way,

220
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,840
don't forget the most important thing.

221
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,360
Find Xiaohu and bring him back to me.

222
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,000
Okay, I'll go arrange it now.

223
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,000
One more thing.

224
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:57,690
Someone touched the things in my room.

225
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:12,200
I might need to find a new place to live soon.

226
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:15,280
Don't worry, there's nothing else.

227
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,140
Just one thing,

228
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,960
you must not come looking for me.

229
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,560
Okay.

230
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,240
Mr. Sun,

231
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,560
this is Wang Hong.

232
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:50,680
Yes.

233
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:54,320
I'm calling to order a batch of birch wood,

234
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,200
but it's a bit urgent.

235
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,560
At the earliest,

236
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,860
can it be done by tomorrow?

237
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,120
That's great.

238
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,760
Okay, thank you.

239
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,880
As for the payment,

240
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:10,280
I'll transfer it to you as soon as possible.

241
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,680
Nian'er.

242
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,920
I have something to tell you.

243
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,520
Listen to me carefully.

244
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,160
I'm listening.

245
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,040
I've thought about it.

246
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,400
You following me around every day like this

247
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,460
really won't work.

248
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,000
You can't keep wasting your time like this.

249
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,360
Why not?

250
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,880
I think it's fine.

251
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,760
You still have to go back to school.

252
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,620
I've already contacted Aunt Wang

253
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,660
to give you some tutoring.

254
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:46,770
That way, you can still catch up for this year's college entrance exam.

255
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,880
Even if you don't get into a bachelor's program,

256
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,120
an associate degree is fine too.

257
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,360
At least you'll have a diploma.

258
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,690
It'll make your life easier in the future.

259
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,320
You won't end up like me for the rest of your life.

260
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,120
I'm not going.

261
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:02,600
Why do you get more disobedient as you grow older?

262
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,240
It's not easy for me to make a living.

263
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,570
This factory could close down at any time.

264
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,120
Life is so long.

265
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,080
Are you

266
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,000
just going to drift along like this?

267
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,530
I don't want to go to school.

268
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,720
I think I'm living a pretty happy life right now.

269
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,920
I don't need anyone telling me what to do.

270
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:17,600
Mom.

271
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,400
Instead of urging me to go to school,

272
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,200
you should think about the wood.

273
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:23,200
That's our top priority.

274
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,860
I'll handle the factory's business.

275
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:28,200
Sit.

276
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:31,720
Chen Nian.

277
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,400
Let me ask you.

278
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,120
Are you really willing

279
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:38,280
to stay in this place for the rest of your life,

280
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:40,960
dealing with wood every day like me?

281
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,240
What's wrong with dealing with wood?

282
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,920
I love dealing with wood.

283
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,720
I'm happy staying in Xinchun.

284
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,890
I'm not going anywhere anyway.

285
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,600
I'll be wherever you are.

286
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,600
Okay.

287
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:55,920
Boss Chen.

288
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:57,920
Chen Lu.

289
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,920
And you say you have no money.

290
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:07,900
Brother Li.

291
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,090
What's the word?

292
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,920
Take away anything made of iron.

293
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:11,960
Move it.

294
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,360
Come on, take it away.

295
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:18,200
Stop.

296
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:21,760
Boss Chen.

297
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,960
We came uninvited.

298
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,040
The deadline is up.

299
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:25,680
You said three days yourself.

300
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,400
Wang Laowu.

301
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,880
We agreed on three days. There's still one day left.

302
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,000
These are the tools I use to make a living.

303
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,920
If you touch them, you're cutting off my livelihood.

304
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,080
What does your livelihood have to do with us?

305
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,210
You've almost cut off our livelihood.

306
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:36,360
Besides,

307
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,520
what difference would another day make?

308
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:39,980
Can you pay back the money?

309
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,160
Can you?

310
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,450
Don't just stand there.

311
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,520
Let go.

312
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:46,360
Let's get

313
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:48,170
one thing straight.

314
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:49,640
If you take these things,

315
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,040
does this debt

316
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,560
get written off?

317
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,080
Impossible.

318
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,240
You're talking nonsense.

319
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:54,920
Let me tell you.

320
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,520
Machines are machines, and money is money.

321
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:58,160
Aren't you afraid of karma?

322
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,080
Karma?

323
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,360
How can you be so cruel?

324
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,120
Think about yourself first.

325
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,160
Move it.

326
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,680
It's your mother who owes us money,

327
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,480
not me.

328
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:10,360
If you have a problem...

329
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,520
Come at me.

330
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:12,200
Let go.

331
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,800
Let go of my daughter.

332
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,400
Come at me if you have the guts.

333
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,760
Come on if you're not afraid to die.

334
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,840
If anyone dares to touch my mom again today,

335
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,720
I'll take them down with me.

336
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:22,800
Let me tell you.

337
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,880
Little girl,

338
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,400
you'd better behave.

339
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,760
You two hold her down.

340
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:27,640
Brother Li, move it.

341
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:28,120
Hold her down.

342
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:28,960
Wang Laowu!

343
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:31,040
I'll block your door every day,

344
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,280
burn your house,

345
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,640
and dig up your ancestral graves.

346
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,840
I mean what I say.

347
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,560
Stop it. Stop.

348
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,440
Stop.

349
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,400
What's wrong, Boss Chen?

350
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:43,320
Figured it out?

351
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:45,160
I don't want the stuff anymore.

352
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,240
Just take it away.

353
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,160
Let go of my daughter.

354
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,360
You should have said that earlier.

355
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:50,960
Let's go.
